  "summary": "Manual extraction for rakudai-kishi-main vol-01. The volume introduces F-rank repeat student Ikki Kurogane and A-rank princess Stella Vermillion as forced roommates, follows Ikki's duel victory over Stella and their developing trust, reunites Ikki with his sister Shizuku and introduces Nagi Arisuin, covers a Rebellion hostage crisis at a shopping center, then centers on Ikki's first official selection battle against former bully Shizuya Kirihara. Stella's public defense enables Ikki to overcome trauma and defeat Kirihara through Perfect Vision, after which Ikki and Stella confess mutual love and promise to meet again in the Seven Stars final.",
